<h2>Writing</h2>
<p>Writing helps me clarify my thoughts. Sharing my work publicly encourages me to aim for higher standards in both writing and thinking. I believe it's important to share ideas and get feedback from others, a practice we don't utilize enough. Over time, I hope this will help my writing and ideas to grow and improve.</p>
